{"3746950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Life, the Universe, and Restaurants","steam_appid":3746950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/015b7dac977325daebe46aa6ec1a6bb5.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=120 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/4807e09d9f1208412de278402787ffa3.avif?t=1793267076\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras_big\/4807e09d9f1208412de278402787ffa3.avif?t=1793267076 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5f800a7840acc2582f11f3652b902abe.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your restaurant for business in the vast reaches of space, take orders, and prepare every dish by hand! Gather ingredients, prep and process them, plate each dish, and serve it—all while racing between the kitchen and Customer Tables to keep up with an ever-growing stream of orders.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much for one person to handle? Leave the work to all kinds of robots! Record your cooking routine, and your robots will repeat it endlessly. They can take orders, cook, serve dishes, transport Coins, and clean up.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher-tier Recipes with increasingly complex preparation steps, then arrange multiple Cooking Robots to work together in sequence. Transform a frantic little kitchen into the most efficient automated production line in the cosmos!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/23c6ddd6ff2dc1d5e2392d035a7ef7ca.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete the business objectives at each stage and upgrade your restaurant from 1 Star all the way to 5 Stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Coins, unlock Recipes, purchase new cookware, and acquire new plots to expand your restaurant. Build more Customer Tables and production facilities, and hire additional robot staff. As your restaurant’s Star Rating increases, you'll unlock more purchasable plots, Recipes, structures, robots, ads, talents, and management systems.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your kitchen grows, your dishes will become more complex—and your customers' demands will become increasingly outrageous. Keep purchasing new plots and expanding your restaurant. Refine your layout, optimize traffic flow, increase production capacity, and take on each Star Upgrade objective. Turn your humble little restaurant into a luxurious, highly efficient 5-Star establishment!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/fd548c1c3f38cb23b2baf3f4c55f2c19.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful restaurant takes more than knowing how to cook. You'll also need a sharp mind for business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different ads to increase the profits from specific dishes—or even reshape your entire business strategy. Build Posters to make customers more likely to order particular dishes, or use TVs to steer them toward a carefully selected menu. Guide your business in exactly the direction you want.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own business build around dish prices, order rates, serving speed, and automation efficiency. Promote the same dish day after day, rotate your menu, specialize in Veggie Dishes or Meat Dishes, and use queue length, your current Coin balance, or even &quot;special events&quot; to keep pushing prices higher. Find your own winning strategy and watch your daily revenue climb!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/80b87b8569ffb8947fad2059e18e8b65.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customer is always right? Well, the customers here really are &quot;gods&quot;—but keeping every last one of them happy isn't necessarily the best way to run your restaurant!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash Bins, lighting, and other unusual methods can all drain your customers' patience. Once they completely lose patience, they'll fly into a rage and become impossible to reason with... which is exactly what you want!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the Cosmic Regulatory Bureau's &quot;self-defense&quot; provisions, you may legally kill unruly customers and harvest their valuable Brains.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Brains of these &quot;gods&quot; to upgrade talents and unlock more powerful brain-based robots. Then deploy Turret Robots, Guards, and other Defense Facilities to protect your restaurant. After all, in this bizarre universe, it was never going to be just about cooking...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/4807e09d9f1208412de278402787ffa3.avif?t=1793267076\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras_big\/4807e09d9f1208412de278402787ffa3.avif?t=1793267076 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5f800a7840acc2582f11f3652b902abe.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your restaurant for business in the vast reaches of space, take orders, and prepare every dish by hand! Gather ingredients, prep and process them, plate each dish, and serve it—all while racing between the kitchen and Customer Tables to keep up with an ever-growing stream of orders.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/2c3929865d0e7f9353a6dcf168173cbe.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much for one person to handle? Leave the work to all kinds of robots! Record your cooking routine, and your robots will repeat it endlessly. They can take orders, cook, serve dishes, transport Coins, and clean up.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/94846d3ab4834344485e34d44b9ff1ca.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher-tier Recipes with increasingly complex preparation steps, then arrange multiple Cooking Robots to work together in sequence. Transform a frantic little kitchen into the most efficient automated production line in the cosmos!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/23c6ddd6ff2dc1d5e2392d035a7ef7ca.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete the business objectives at each stage and upgrade your restaurant from 1 Star all the way to 5 Stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Coins, unlock Recipes, purchase new cookware, and acquire new plots to expand your restaurant. Build more Customer Tables and production facilities, and hire additional robot staff. As your restaurant’s Star Rating increases, you'll unlock more purchasable plots, Recipes, structures, robots, ads, talents, and management systems.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/249867d2430be4ccddb8e89ec2086801.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your kitchen grows, your dishes will become more complex—and your customers' demands will become increasingly outrageous. Keep purchasing new plots and expanding your restaurant. Refine your layout, optimize traffic flow, increase production capacity, and take on each Star Upgrade objective. Turn your humble little restaurant into a luxurious, highly efficient 5-Star establishment!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/5d17aba0dfb93047aa64d40c0285d11e.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/fd548c1c3f38cb23b2baf3f4c55f2c19.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful restaurant takes more than knowing how to cook. You'll also need a sharp mind for business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different ads to increase the profits from specific dishes—or even reshape your entire business strategy. Build Posters to make customers more likely to order particular dishes, or use TVs to steer them toward a carefully selected menu. Guide your business in exactly the direction you want.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/8680dc1a66be3bd5b81f09a4b61b6bb9.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own business build around dish prices, order rates, serving speed, and automation efficiency. Promote the same dish day after day, rotate your menu, specialize in Veggie Dishes or Meat Dishes, and use queue length, your current Coin balance, or even &quot;special events&quot; to keep pushing prices higher. Find your own winning strategy and watch your daily revenue climb!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/e1e01ace84e236c80376afac64164372.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/80b87b8569ffb8947fad2059e18e8b65.avif?t=1793267076\" width=800 height=129 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customer is always right? Well, the customers here really are &quot;gods&quot;—but keeping every last one of them happy isn't necessarily the best way to run your restaurant!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash Bins, lighting, and other unusual methods can all drain your customers' patience. Once they completely lose patience, they'll fly into a rage and become impossible to reason with... which is exactly what you want!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the Cosmic Regulatory Bureau's &quot;self-defense&quot; provisions, you may legally kill unruly customers and harvest their valuable Brains.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/12fbc9ab7917a19af3faf042bfddf0c4.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Brains of these &quot;gods&quot; to upgrade talents and unlock more powerful brain-based robots. Then deploy Turret Robots, Guards, and other Defense Facilities to protect your restaurant. After all, in this bizarre universe, it was never going to be just about cooking...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.poster.avif?t=1793267076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.webm?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/extras\/d924f606ec610362e9aa29c87558b81e.mp4?t=1793267076\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Run a restaurant in a bizarre universe and cook for customers who call themselves &quot;gods&quot;! Expand your restaurant, deploy robots, and automate your kitchen. Keep business booming—and be ready to deal with any unruly customers.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/504f782986861f4711a049466c364aeff3b8eec8\/header.jpg?t=1793267076","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/5b1d6ee6d70c363e1d6738822122bbe2f94b9050\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793267076","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/5b1d6ee6d70c363e1d6738822122bbe2f94b9050\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793267076","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or 11 64bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>  Intel® Core™ i5-6xxx, AMD FX™-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8  GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750 or AMD Radeon™ R7 265<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["GARRY"],"publishers":["Gamersky Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1499,"final":1499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$14.99"},"packages":[1318776],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Life, the Universe, and Restaurants","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1318776,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Life, the Universe, and Restaurants - $14.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":60,"description":"Gamepad Recommended"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3746950\/17d636401259bcac90e0983294a895c05399190d\/ss_17d636401259bcac90e0983294a895c05399190d.600x338.jpg?t=1793267076","path_full":"https